{{!
    @template local_coursepilot/ortswahl_instances

    Instanzliste im Dateifenster der Ortswahl (Issue #551), gefuellt vom
    AMD-Modul amd/src/ortswahl.js statt aus Zeichenketten zusammengebaut.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * instances - array - list of {id, name, active, disabled, reason}
      * id - int - instance id, carried in data-instance-id for the click handler
      * name - string - instance display name
      * active - bool - whether this is the currently browsed instance
      * disabled - bool - whether the instance cannot be selected (see reason)
      * reason - string - reason text shown as title when disabled

    Example context (json):
    {
        "instances": [
            {"id": 1, "name": "Meine Nextcloud", "active": true, "disabled": false, "reason": ""},
            {"id": 2, "name": "IServ", "active": false, "disabled": true, "reason": "Nur Dateien, keine Ordnerwahl."}
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="list-group">
{{#instances}}
    <button type="button"
            class="list-group-item list-group-item-action{{#active}} active{{/active}}{{#disabled}} text-muted{{/disabled}}"
            data-instance-id="{{id}}"
            {{#disabled}}disabled{{/disabled}}
            title="{{reason}}">{{name}}</button>
{{/instances}}
</div>
